          "aspectCode": "R",
          "semanticRole": "What the function needs or consumes during execution",
          "description": "Resource (R) is what the function needs when it is carried out \nor what it consumes to produce the Output. Unlike Preconditions, Resources are \ntypically used up or occupied during function execution.\nExamples: Tools, equipment, energy, money, manpower, software, time allocation."
        },
