          "description": "Control (C) is how the function is monitored, supervised, or \nregulated so that it can adjust to produce the required Output. Control represents \nthe regulation or governance of the function.\nExamples: Procedures, guidelines, supervisory oversight, feedback loops, \nmonitoring systems, regulations.",
